							message : "<div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\"><br>Information : Il s'agit d'un email automatique.<br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">Référénce :&nbsp;${DAE_Num_ro_de_s_rie}</span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">Type de visite : ${Type_de_visite}</span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">Annotations : ${Pr_cisions_l_op_rateur_territorial}</span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">Date de visite prévue : ${Quand_l_op_rateur_doit_passer}</span></span><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">Lieu de l'intervention :&nbsp;<br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">${Localisation_de_la_visite.address_line_1} </span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">${Localisation_de_la_visite.address_line_2}<br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">${Localisation_de_la_visite.district_city} </span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">${Localisation_de_la_visite.state_province}</span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">${Localisation_de_la_visite.postal_Code} </span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">${Localisation_de_la_visite.country}</span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">Technicien : ${Quel_op_rateur_doit_faire_la_visite}<br><br>Référence interne : ${Auto_Number}</span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">Important : Si ce créneau ne vous convient pas, si vous remarquez une erreur ; veuillez répondre à cet email.</span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\"></span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\" class=\"size\">L'équipe Cardiac Safe,</span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Lato, sans-serif\" class=\"font\"><span style=\"font-size:10.6667px\" class=\"size\"><a style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 238);\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://saasduo.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Logiciel édité par SaaSduo</a></span></span><br></div>"
